 "ruler": "<div class=\"vc-ruler\">\n          <div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"时间尺：1950 年到 2026 年，五个时代按年数排开。起源 36 年，机器学习 26 年，深度学习 5 年，大语言模型 6 年，智能体 4 年。\">\n            <div class=\"vc-ruler-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              \n                <span class=\"vc-ruler-seg\" style=\"--vc-ruler-span: 36;\"><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 0.69%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 14.58%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 22.92%;\"></i></span>\n              \n                <span class=\"vc-ruler-seg\" style=\"--vc-ruler-span: 26;\"><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 0.96%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 47.12%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 77.88%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 89.42%;\"></i></span>\n              \n                <span class=\"vc-ruler-seg\" style=\"--vc-ruler-span: 5;\"><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 5.00%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 45.00%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 65.00%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 85.00%;\"></i></span>\n              \n                <span class=\"vc-ruler-seg\" style=\"--vc-ruler-span: 6;\"><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 4.17%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 37.50%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 54.17%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 58.33%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 87.50%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 91.67%;\"></i></span>\n              \n                <span class=\"vc-ruler-seg\" style=\"--vc-ruler-span: 4;\"><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 6.25%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 31.25%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 37.50%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 43.75%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 56.25%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 62.50%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 81.25%;\"></i><i class=\"vc-ruler-dot\" style=\"--vc-ruler-at: 87.50%;\"></i></span>\n              \n            </div>\n            <div class=\"vc-ruler-years\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              \n                <span class=\"\" style=\"--vc-ruler-span: 36;\">1950</span>\n              \n                <span class=\"\" style=\"--vc-ruler-span: 26;\">1986</span>\n              \n                <span class=\"\" style=\"--vc-ruler-span: 5;\">2012</span>\n              \n                <span class=\"is-tight\" style=\"--vc-ruler-span: 6;\">2017</span>\n              \n                <span class=\"is-tight\" style=\"--vc-ruler-span: 4;\">2023</span>\n              \n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"vc-type-footnote vc-sub vc-ruler-note\">一格一个时代，宽度按年数，圆点是里程碑。前两个时代走了 62 年，后三个时代到今年一共 15 年。</p>\n          <nav class=\"vc-era-jump\" id=\"eras\" aria-label=\"跳到某个时代\">\n            \n              <a href=\"#era-origins\">起源</a>\n            \n              <a href=\"#era-ml\">机器学习</a>\n            \n              <a href=\"#era-dl\">深度学习</a>\n            \n              <a href=\"#era-llm\">大语言模型</a>\n            \n              <a href=\"#era-agents\">智能体</a>\n            \n          </nav>\n        </div>",
 "nest": "<div class=\"vc-nest\">\n          <div class=\"vc-nest-ring\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"五种工程范式一层包一层：提示词工程在最里面，往外依次是上下文工程、Harness 工程、Loop 工程、Graph 工程。\">\n            <div class=\"vc-nest-ring\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n              <div class=\"vc-nest-ring\">\n                <div class=\"vc-nest-ring\">\n                  <p class=\"vc-nest-core\"><span>提示词工程</span><span class=\"mono\">2022–2024</span></p>\n                  <p class=\"vc-nest-row\"><span>上下文工程</span><span class=\"mono\">2025</span></p>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"vc-nest-row\"><span>Harness 工程</span><span class=\"mono\">2026 年初</span></p>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"vc-nest-row\"><span>Loop 工程</span><span class=\"mono\">2026 年</span></p>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"vc-nest-row\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span>Graph 工程</span><span class=\"mono\">正在出现</span></p>\n          </div>\n          <p class=\"vc-type-footnote vc-sub\">后一层把前一层包在里面，最里面的最早：人从写每一句指令，转向设计让智能体自己运转的系统。</p>\n        </div>",
 "paradigm": "<section class=\"vc-paradigm\" id=\"harness-engineering\" aria-labelledby=\"harness-engineering-name\">\n            <div class=\"vc-paradigm-head\">\n              <p class=\"vc-paradigm-when\">2026 年初</p>\n              <h3 id=\"harness-engineering-name\" class=\"vc-era-name\">Harness 工程</h3>\n              <p class=\"vc-paradigm-problem\">智能体周围的工具、权限和验证环境怎么搭。Harness 指套在模型外面的那层软件。</p>\n              \n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"vc-card-grid\">\n              \n                <li id=\"shopify-harness\">\n                  \n                    <a class=\"vc-card vc-card-link\" href=\"/mind/shopify-harness\" aria-labelledby=\"shopify-harness-t\">\n                      <p class=\"vc-row-kind\">文章 · 原文英文 · 3 分钟视频</p>\n                      <h4 id=\"shopify-harness-t\" class=\"row-title vc-serif\">比模型更耐久的 Harness</h4>\n                      <p class=\"vc-row-line\">Shopify 用测试证明漏洞，而不是收集模型给出的候选清单。</p>\n                      <p class=\"vc-row-foot\">发布于 <time datetime=\"2026-10-31\">2026-10-31</time></p>\n                    </a>\n                  \n                  \n                </li>\n              \n                <li id=\"claude-code-review\">\n                  \n                    <a class=\"vc-card vc-card-link\" href=\"/mind/claude-code-review\" aria-labelledby=\"claude-code-review-t\">\n                      <p class=\"vc-row-kind\">文章 · 原文英文</p>\n                      <h4 id=\"claude-code-review-t\" class=\"row-title vc-serif\">Claude Code 团队如何做 Code Review</h4>\n                      <p class=\"vc-row-line\">阅读交给机器，判断留在人这里；自动通过不等于没有人负责。</p>\n                      <p class=\"vc-row-foot\">发布于 <time datetime=\"2026-10-15\">2026-10-15</time></p>\n                    </a>\n                  \n                  \n                </li>\n              \n            </ul>\n          </section>",
 "paradigm_tool": "<section class=\"vc-paradigm\" id=\"prompt-engineering\" aria-labelledby=\"prompt-engineering-name\">\n            <div class=\"vc-paradigm-head\">\n              <p class=\"vc-paradigm-when\">2022–2024</p>\n              <h3 id=\"prompt-engineering-name\" class=\"vc-era-name\">提示词工程</h3>\n              <p class=\"vc-paradigm-problem\">怎样把指令写清楚。</p>\n              \n            </div>\n            <ul class=\"vc-card-grid\">\n              \n                <li id=\"anthropic-prompt-guide\">\n                  \n                  \n                    <a class=\"vc-card vc-card-link\" href=\"https://docs.claude.com/en/docs/build-with-claude/prompt-engineering/overview\" aria-labelledby=\"anthropic-prompt-guide-t\">\n                      <p class=\"vc-row-kind\">工具 · 英文</p>\n                      <h4 id=\"anthropic-prompt-guide-t\" class=\"row-title vc-serif\">Anthropic 提示词工程指南</h4>\n                      <dl class=\"vc-card-facts\">\n                        <div><dt>是什么</dt><dd>官方文档里讲提示词的一章：把指令写清楚、给例子、让模型先想再答、用标签把内容分段。</dd></div>\n                        <div><dt>怎么用</dt><dd>拿一条自己正在用的提示词，照着逐条改，对比改前改后的输出。</dd></div>\n                        <div><dt>适合谁</dt><dd>刚开始写提示词，或者输出不稳定、不知道从哪里改起的人。</dd></div>\n                      </dl>\n                      <p class=\"vc-row-foot\"><span class=\"vc-row-go\">读原文</span></p>\n                    </a>\n                  \n                </li>\n              \n            </ul>\n          </section>",
 "path": "<nav class=\"vc-path\" aria-label=\"四级\">\n        \n          <a href=\"#level-1\"><span class=\"mono\">第 1 级</span><span class=\"vc-path-name\">基础</span><span class=\"vc-path-count\">2 项</span></a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#level-2\"><span class=\"mono\">第 2 级</span><span class=\"vc-path-name\">智能体</span><span class=\"vc-path-count\">3 项</span></a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#level-3\"><span class=\"mono\">第 3 级</span><span class=\"vc-path-name\">模型</span><span class=\"vc-path-count\">3 项</span></a>\n        \n          <a href=\"#level-4\"><span class=\"mono\">第 4 级</span><span class=\"vc-path-name\">前沿</span><span class=\"vc-path-count\">2 项</span></a>\n        \n      </nav>",
 "level": "<section class=\"vc-level\" id=\"level-2\" aria-labelledby=\"level-2-name\">\n        <div class=\"vc-level-head\"><h2 id=\"level-2-name\" class=\"vc-level-name\">第 2 级 · 智能体</h2><p class=\"vc-level-goal\">学完能做到：会把任务交给智能体，也能自己搭一个简单的智能体。</p></div>\n        <ol class=\"vc-steps\">\n          \n            <li class=\"vc-step\" id=\"building-effective-agents\">\n              \n                <details class=\"vc-step-fold\" data-expand=\"inline\">\n                  <summary class=\"vc-step-sum\">\n                    <span class=\"vc-step-n\">2.1</span>\n                    <h3 class=\"vc-step-name\">Building effective agents</h3>\n                    <span class=\"vc-step-facts\"><span>Anthropic</span> <span>·&nbsp;文章</span> <span>·&nbsp;约&nbsp;1&nbsp;小时</span> </span>\n                    <span class=\"vc-step-why\">先分清工作流和智能体，知道什么时候不该用智能体。</span>\n                  </summary>\n                  <div class=\"vc-step-more\">\n                    <dl class=\"vc-step-body\"><div><dt>学到什么程度</dt><dd>分得清工作流和智能体，知道文中几种搭法各适合什么样的任务。</dd></div><div><dt>怎么检验</dt><dd>为自己的一件任务选工作流或智能体，写下理由。</dd></div></dl>\n                    <p class=\"vc-step-foot\">\n                      <a class=\"vc-quick vc-quick-small\" href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/building-effective-agents\" aria-label=\"打开课程：Building effective agents\">打开课程</a>\n                      <a class=\"vc-quick vc-quick-small\" href=\"/mind#building-effective-agents-2024\">相关里程碑：《Building effective agents》（2024）</a>\n                      <span>最后核对 <time datetime=\"2026-11-04\">2026-11-04</time></span>\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </details>\n              \n              \n            </li>\n          \n            <li class=\"vc-step\" id=\"agentic-ai\">\n              \n              \n                <details class=\"vc-step-fold\" data-expand=\"inline\" open=\"\">\n                  <summary class=\"vc-step-sum\">\n                    <span class=\"vc-step-n\">2.2</span>\n                    <h3 class=\"vc-step-name\">Agentic AI</h3>\n                    <span class=\"vc-step-facts\"><span>吴恩达 · DeepLearning.AI</span> <span>·&nbsp;课程</span> <span>·&nbsp;约&nbsp;10&nbsp;小时</span> </span>\n                    <span class=\"vc-step-why\">把反思、调用工具、规划、多个智能体分工这几种做法，一个个亲手搭一遍。</span>\n                  </summary>\n                  <div class=\"vc-step-more\">\n                    <dl class=\"vc-step-body\"><div><dt>学到什么程度</dt><dd>四种做法各搭过一遍，说得出每种在什么时候值得用。</dd></div><div><dt>怎么检验</dt><dd>搭出一个会调用工具、会检查自己结果的智能体。</dd></div></dl>\n                    <p class=\"vc-step-foot\">\n                      <a class=\"vc-quick vc-quick-small\" href=\"https://www.deeplearning.ai/courses/agentic-ai\" aria-label=\"打开课程：Agentic AI\">打开课程</a>\n                      <a class=\"vc-quick vc-quick-small\" href=\"/mind#react-2022\">相关里程碑：ReAct（2022）</a>\n                      <span>最后核对 <time datetime=\"2026-11-04\">2026-11-04</time></span>\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </details>\n              \n            </li>\n          \n            <li class=\"vc-step\" id=\"anthropic-academy\">\n              \n                <details class=\"vc-step-fold\" data-expand=\"inline\">\n                  <summary class=\"vc-step-sum\">\n                    <span class=\"vc-step-n\">2.3</span>\n                    <h3 class=\"vc-step-name\">Claude Code、MCP、Agent Skills 课程</h3>\n                    <span class=\"vc-step-facts\"><span>Anthropic Academy</span> <span>·&nbsp;课程</span> <span>·&nbsp;约&nbsp;8&nbsp;小时</span> </span>\n                    <span class=\"vc-step-why\">把智能体接进自己每天用的工具和代码库。</span>\n                  </summary>\n                  <div class=\"vc-step-more\">\n                    <dl class=\"vc-step-body\"><div><dt>学到什么程度</dt><dd>会用 Claude Code 做完一件多步的任务，会接一个 MCP 服务，会写一个 Agent Skill。</dd></div><div><dt>怎么检验</dt><dd>给自己的项目写一个 Agent Skill，让 Claude Code 照着它把一件事做完。</dd></div></dl>\n                    <p class=\"vc-step-foot\">\n                      <a class=\"vc-quick vc-quick-small\" href=\"https://anthropic.skilljar.com/\" aria-label=\"打开课程：Claude Code、MCP、Agent Skills 课程\">打开课程</a>\n                      <a class=\"vc-quick vc-quick-small\" href=\"/mind#mcp-2024\">相关里程碑：模型上下文协议（2024）</a>\n                      <span>最后核对 <time datetime=\"2026-11-04\">2026-11-04</time></span>\n                    </p>\n                  </div>\n                </details>\n              \n              \n            </li>\n          \n        </ol>\n      </section>",
 "meta": "<div class=\"vc-meta vc-read-wide\">\n      <dl class=\"vc-meta-row\" aria-label=\"谁写的、什么时候\">\n        <div><dt>作者</dt><dd>Zack Deveau，Shopify Engineering</dd></div>\n        <div><dt>原文</dt><dd><time datetime=\"2026-07-29\">2026-07-29</time> · <a href=\"https://shopify.engineering/building-an-agentic-harness-that-outlasts-the-model\">读原文</a></dd></div>\n        <div><dt>发布</dt><dd><time datetime=\"2026-10-31\">2026-10-31</time></dd></div>\n      </dl>\n      <dl class=\"vc-meta-row\" aria-label=\"我们核对了什么\">\n        <div><dt>最后核对</dt><dd><time datetime=\"2026-11-04\">2026-11-04</time></dd></div>\n        <div><dt>适用于</dt><dd>Harness 工程，和具体模型无关</dd></div>\n        <div><dt>授权</dt><dd>讲解和摘要，不是全文翻译</dd></div>\n        <div><dt>时长</dt><dd>12 分钟 · 有 3 分钟视频</dd></div>\n      </dl>\n    </div>",
 "take": "<section class=\"vc-take vc-read-col\" aria-labelledby=\"take-t\">\n    <h2 id=\"take-t\" class=\"kicker\">我们的判断</h2>\n    <p class=\"vc-type-body-reading\" lang=\"zh-CN\"><strong>值得读。</strong>适合在做代码审查、安全扫描自动化的工程师。它讲清了一件容易被忽略的事。换一个更强的模型，可能只带来更多要人确认的候选。真正留得下来的，是能证明结论的那层软件。代价是先要写出能证明问题的测试，前期投入比直接让模型去找大。</p>\n  </section>",
 "toc": "<details class=\"vc-fold vc-toc\" data-expand=\"inline\">\n    <summary>目录</summary>\n    <nav aria-label=\"目录\"><ol lang=\"zh-CN\">\n      <li><a href=\"#noise\">更强的模型带来更多噪声</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#dispatch\">编排器 Dispatch</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#six-weeks\">六周的账</a></li>\n      <li><a href=\"#practice\">先写证明，再让智能体去找</a></li>\n    </ol></nav>\n  </details>",
 "video": "<figure class=\"vc-video vc-read-wide\">\n      <div class=\"vc-video-frame\" data-video=\"\">\n        <div class=\"vc-video-shot \" aria-hidden=\"false\"><p class=\"kicker\">用大白话</p><p class=\"vc-video-title\" lang=\"zh-CN\">证明不了，就不算发现</p></div>\n        <span class=\"vc-video-scrim\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n        <div class=\"vc-playbar lg lg-on-dark\" data-backdrop=\"video\" data-lens=\"\">\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"icon-btn vc-playbar-play\" aria-label=\"播放 3 分钟视频\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 2.5 L13 8 L4 13.5 Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></svg></button>\n          <span class=\"vc-playbar-label\">3 分钟视频</span>\n          <span class=\"mono\">0:00 / 2:24</span>\n          <span class=\"vc-playbar-space\"></span>\n          <button type=\"button\" class=\"vc-quick vc-quick-small vc-playbar-cc\" aria-pressed=\"false\">字幕</button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <figcaption>旁白用合成音色「晓晓」。</figcaption>\n      <details class=\"vc-fold vc-read-col\" id=\"transcript\" data-expand=\"inline\">\n        <summary>文字稿</summary>\n        <div class=\"vc-transcript\">\n          <p><b>用大白话</b><span lang=\"zh-CN\">Shopify 应用安全团队做的不是让模型列出可能的漏洞。他们要一张能证明漏洞真的可以被利用的测试。证明不了，就不算发现。理论上的发现不计。模型会换。Harness 留下。</span></p><p><b>容易听错</b><span lang=\"zh-CN\">更强的模型不等于更少的噪声。他们评估了大约五个月。新模型更能提出候选，也制造更多要确认的东西。有一次审计，三十多个候选，验证之后全部被降级、判成误报，或改记为纵深防御。所以耐久的资产不是当周的模型，而是周围那层软件：循环、工具、分区、证明和确定性脚本。</span></p><p><b>一个比喻</b><span lang=\"zh-CN\">模型像会换的筛网。Harness 是筛子的框、阶段和记录。框比网耐用。Dispatch 是那个轻的 Ruby 编排器。扫描按阶段走：引导测试、写架构、编目、分区、搜寻、验证、后处理、报告、修复。不能用真实集成测试证明可利用性的发现不被接受。</span></p><p><b>不能译的原件</b><span lang=\"zh-CN\">原文有一张头图和三张手绘图，图里的英文不译。头图没有图注。一张图题是 DISPATCH，画了 Ruby、sandbox、proxy 和允许的主机。一张画了 PARALLEL 的搜寻和 SEQUENTIAL 的验证。一张画了 shared scope 和 partition scope。阶段名 Test bootstrap、Hunting、Verification 也保留英文。这些图按原文件嵌在正文里。</span></p><p><b>一句话</b><span lang=\"zh-CN\">模型会换。留下的是循环、分区、证明和确定性脚本。原文里的六周账是内部估算：八十多个应用，三百多个发现，其中两个按内部严重性会记为 Critical，总价值保守估在超过四十万美元的等值赏金。这不是公开赏金的支付记录，也不是本站复测。</span></p>\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </figure>",
